[00:10.76]How can we endure
[00:14.30]When trials come, as Jesus said?
[00:20.20]Through his pain he saw
[00:23.46]The joy of better things ahead.
[00:29.58]God’s promise, God’s justice,
[00:34.46]Were thoughts on which he fed.
[00:39.25](Chorus)
[00:39.40]We need to have endurance.
[00:44.42]Our faith we must defend.
[00:49.36]His love is our assurance.
[00:54.32]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[01:03.70]Though the passing years
[01:13.68]May bring us sorrow, bring us pain;
[01:19.68]There beyond the tears,
[01:23.60]We see the life that we can gain.
[01:28.42]To be there, feel free there,
[01:33.96]Determined we remain.
[01:38.71](Chorus)
[01:38.86]We need to have endurance.
[01:43.82]Our faith we must defend.
[01:47.77]His love is our assurance.
[01:53.38]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[02:19.48]We will not give up
[02:22.98]Nor see the need for doubt or fear.
[02:28.93]Faithfully we’ll serve
[02:33.06]Until Jehovah’s day is here.
[02:38.08]Let’s keep on enduring.
[02:43.16]That time is very near.
[02:47.95](Chorus)
[02:48.10]We need to have endurance.
[02:53.06]Our faith we must defend.
[02:56.82]His love is our assurance.
[03:02.90]So we will keep enduring to the end.
